{"id":"fru_h","lemma":"früh","pos":"adv","rank":418,"glosses":["early","in the morning (general in morgen früh, otherwise regional, especially Eastern Germany, Southern Germany, Austria)"],"ipa":"/fʁyː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/13/De-fr%C3%BCh.ogg/De-fr%C3%BCh.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ist es zu früh?","en":"Is it too early?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/215159","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Bin ich zu früh dran?","en":"Am I too early?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/250024","words":[{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to / too"},null,{"g":"to be in a particular…"}]},{"text":"Warum sind Sie so früh?","en":"Why are you so early?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Ihr seid zu früh gekommen.","en":"You've come too early.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755348","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Ich gehe sehr früh zu Bett.","en":"I go to bed very early.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755084","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture"}]}]}